-~> Modules can use each other: a use of a module that is still loading
-~> sees the names it has defined so far, and the rest as they come.
use "modules/cycle/input"
use "modules/cycle/paint"
puts(seen_at_load)
puts(press())
puts(press())
-~> The hash of use ... as is filled when the module has run, even when it
-~> was taken during the cycle.
puts(has_press())
